[9025]="70062E38\n1\tDefeat the Blogmal gang-leader\tYou should defeat the Blogmal gang-leader.\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[9026]="7005811D\n1\tComplete Mission: The Three Wardens\tYour mission is to defeat the wardens of Caivád Sâr. Speak to Ausma to travel to Caivád Sâr.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[9027]="70058121\n1\tDefeat Senga\030Defeat Avlaith\030Defeat Tárlakh\tDefeat the wardens of Caivád Sâr.\n",
[9028]="7005830F\n1\tFind the missing piece of the gate mechanism\tThe gate to the throne-room of Tharrazhâr has been sealed by the forces of Gundabad and the mechanism to open it is missing a piece. You should find the missing piece of the gate mechanism.\n2\tOpen the gate to the Throne of Tharrazhâr\tYou have found the missing piece of the gate mechanism, and you should now use the gate mechanism to open the gate to the throne-room of Tharrazhâr.\n3\tDefeat Graznúl\tYou have cleared a path to the hobgoblin leading the forces of Gundabad in the Keep of Tharrazhâr. You should defeat Graznúl.\n",
[9029]="70058310\n1\tComplete 'Mission: The Throne of Tharrazhâr'\tYour mission is to break through the defences of an Orkish invasion in the Keep of Tharrazhâr and defeat the hobgoblin known as Graznúl. You should talk to Hórin and travel to Skarháld.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[9030]="70066B51\n1\tSpeak with the Captain\tWe made our way to shore with the intent of beaching the Corsairs there. I remember how the sea air smelled as we rowed ashore....\n2\tScuttle Corsair launch boats ([see journal]/4)\tMy orders were clear, find the launches, scuttle them and return forthwith. It was a take not without danger, but the risk was clear....\n3\tFind and defeat Yarikh and his crew ([see journal]/24)\tWith the boats scuttled, there was no retreat back to sea for the Corsairs. I sensed a chance for true glory and forged ahead to find Yarikh and his crew....\n4\tReturn to where you landed\tThe Corsair's ruse worked too well. While we came ashore they assaulted the Nenglor. I returned to the spot where we landed and stared at our launches retreating to the Corsair's vessel....\n",
[9031]="70062E35\n1\tFind and defeat the gaunt-lord corrupting Gond Orchal\030Defeat Gond Orchal Wights (total: 14)\tA gaunt-lord is corrupting Gond Orchal. Clear the tombs of Wights and defeat this evil.\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[9032]="70062E37\n1\tComplete the Mission: The Tombs of Gond Orchal\tSpeak with the mission giver to travel to the tomb. Defeat Wights and the Gond Orchal war-monger.\n2\tReturn to Baglan and tell him you have defeated the evil\tWith your mission in Gond Orchal successful, you should return to the mission giver.\n",
[9033]="7005955A\n1\tComplete Mission: The Trestlebridge Ambush\tYour mission is to investigate a fire in the Wildwood, then quickly return to town. Speak to Radhril.\n2\tTalk to Radhril\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Radhril for your reward!\n",
[9034]="70059566\n1\tPick up the summoning horn\tUse the summoning horn west of Trestlebridge to summon Radhril to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Radhril skill and talk to Radhril\tYou should talk to Radhril. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tSecure the western courtyard\tYou should secure the western courtyard. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n4\tSecure the Trestlespan\tYou should secure the Trestlespan. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n5\tSecure the southern courtyard\tYou should secure the southern courtyard. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n6\tSecure the southern gate\tYou should secure the southern gate. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n",
