[9037]="7006EBE8\n1\tComplete Mission: The Waggons of War\tYour mission is to intercept a caravan of waggons filled with supplies and weapons, defeat and soldiers guarding it, and turn over the caravan to Mizâdi's forces. Speak to Setokúli to travel.\n2\tTalk to Setokúli\tYour mission is to intercept a caravan of waggons filled with supplies and weapons, defeat and soldiers guarding it, and turn over the caravan to Mizâdi's forces.\n",
