[9047]="7005A71F\n1\tTake weapons from the Orc encampment (total: 6)\030Destroy provisions at the Orc encampment (total: 10)\030Take totems from the hobgoblin encampment (total: 6)\030Destroy supplies at the hobgoblin encampment (total: 10)\tWork to sabotage both the Orc encampment and the hobgoblin encampment.\n2\tPlace hobgoblin totems in the Orc encampment (quantity: see journal)\030Place Orc weapons in the hobgoblin encampment (quantity: see journal)\tContinue work to sabotage both the Orc encampment and the hobgoblin encampment.\n3\tReturn to Zóva\tReturn to Zóva.\n4\tWait with Zóva and see if your plan works\tWait with Zóva and see if your plan works.\n",
[9048]="7005A71C\n1\tTalk to the Dourhand guests\tTalk to the Dourhand guests.\n2\tPolish the Dourhand axes (total: 3)\tPolish the Dourhand axes.\n3\tTalk to the Dourhands\tTalk to the Dourhands.\n4\tFetch ales for the Dourhands (total: 3)\tFetch ales for the Dourhands.\n5\tBring ales to the Dourhand guests\tBring ales to the Dourhand guests.\n6\tDance with the Dourhands.\t\n7\tTalk to the Dourhands\tTalk to the Dourhands.\n8\tFetch the Dourhands some food (total: 3)\tFetch the Dourhands some food.\n9\tBring the food to the Dourhands\tBring the food to the Dourhands.\n10\tWitness the events transpire\tWitness the events transpire.\n11\tFight the angry Dourhands!\t\n12\tTalk to Prince Ingór\tTalk to Prince Ingór.\n",
[9049]="7005A71A\n1\tPick up the summoning horn\tUse the summoning horn at the beginning of the mission to summon Prince Ingór to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Prince Ingór skill and talk to Ingór\tYou should talk to Prince Ingór. If Prince Ingór is missing, and the Call Prince Ingór skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tFight the cold-drake horde\tFight the cold-drake horde. If Prince Ingór is missing, and the Call Prince Ingór skill is not available, try using the /pet release command. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tDefeat Svalnath\tDefeat Svalnath. If Prince Ingór is missing, and the Call Prince Ingór skill is not available, try using the /pet release command. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[9050]="7006D1C5\n1\tComplete Mission: Thieves of Antiquity\tYour mission is to stop thieving Corsairs from stealing artifacts from the ruins of Telperiën's Wall, by any means necessary. Talk to Khâdamul when you are ready to travel.\n2\tTalk to Khâdamul in Iridír\tYou have dealt with the thieving Corsairs stealing artifacts from the ruins of Telperiën's Wall. Return with the Dumûri scout to report your success.\n",
[9051]="7006E4D1\n1\tComplete Mission: Thornley's Revenge\tYou have been given the dangerous task of entering the Tarkrîp encampment and delivering Thornely's revenge upon the Orcs there.\n2\tTalk to the Hooded Stranger in The Prancing Pony\tYou have successfully dealt with the Tarkrîp Orcs and the Red Reaver. You should talk to Rose Thornley and then give your report to the Hooded Stranger.\n",
