[9053]="70066B52\n1\tDefeat the Corsairs in the cavern ([see journal]/10)\030Collect the treasure chest\tThe information proved true, and I found myself within a yawning maw of a cavern. All throughout the sound of men and women shuffling goods and coin. Could retribution be at hand?\n2\tReturn to the captain at the cavern entrance\tWith the spoils in hand, I made my way back to the entrance....\n",
