[9056]="70072F3E\n1\tComplete Mission: Treasure for the Taking\tYour mission is to infiltrate and retrieve the items stolen from the Beltáni. You should travel to the robber camp, Kidu-bâla, and retrieve the stolen valuables.\n2\tSpeak with Shâpar in Ahaba\tYou have retrieved the items stolen from the Beltáni. Return with Shâpar to report your success.\n",
